[node name="ApartmentKitchenWindow" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Window 1.9 x 1.5 m, 1 bay(s), opening 0.9..2.4 m above the floor. Origin on the room floor at the opening's center on the wall's center line; -Z is outside. GENERATED by tools/props/window.py from tools/props/windows/ (apartment_kitchen); edit the spec, not this file. Panel on the west side: top button runs the shades (press again to stop, again to reverse), bottom button steps the smart glass tint (clear, half, dark)."

